#: notes@maestroschan.fr/prefs.ui
msgid ""
"Click on this button if you accidentally moved a note out of your primary "
"monitor (example: if you had notes on a secondary monitor and unplugged it)."
msgstr ""
"Klikni ovaj gumb, ako si slučajno premjestio/la bilješku s glavnog monitora "
"(primjer: ako si imao/la bilješke na sporednom monitoru kojeg si odspojio/"
"la)."

#: notes@maestroschan.fr/prefs.ui
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring back to the primary monitor"
msgstr "Vrati sve bilješke na glavni monitor"

#: notes@maestroschan.fr/prefs.ui
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Sticky notes for the GNOME Shell desktop."
msgid "(fork of the sticky notes extension for the GNOME Shell desktop)"
msgstr "Bilješke za GNOME Shell desktop."

#: notes@maestroschan.fr/prefs.ui
msgid ""
"Reworked design and extended functionality:\n"
"• Improved visual style and interface\n"
"• Better sticky notes on the screen\n"
"• Text context menu with edit history\n"
"• New notes from the clipboard\n"
"• Note expanding for long texts\n"
"• New notes with a double click on the panel icon\n"
"• A click outside the notes hides them (optional)\n"
"• Color filter in the panel menu\n"
"• Proper multi-monitor support"
msgstr ""

